    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισχύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make strong</i> or
				<i>powerful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					11.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>to
				be</i> or <i>grow strong,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.1.4
			</span></i>; <i>prevail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				7
			</span></i> ; <i>to be urgent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχυον λέγοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					23.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λόγος -ύσει πρὸς συμβουλίαν ἢ
					διδαχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					48.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
